    "translations": {
      "en": {
        "Lógica de 5 V. ADC por defecto 10 bits (hasta 14); PWM 8 bits y DAC A0 de 12 bits. USB nativo, Serial1 libre en D0/D1. Probada en hardware con RobotBlocks.": "5 V logic. Default 10-bit ADC (up to 14); 8-bit PWM and 12-bit A0 DAC. Native USB, Serial1 free on D0/D1. Tested on hardware with RobotBlocks.",
        "Serial1 RX; libre porque Serial usa USB nativo.": "Serial1 RX; free because Serial uses native USB.",
        "Serial1 TX; libre porque Serial usa USB nativo.": "Serial1 TX; free because Serial uses native USB.",
        "LED integrado; alto enciende, bajo apaga. Compartido con SPI SCK.": "Built-in LED; high turns it on, low turns it off. Shared with SPI SCK.",
        "DAC de 12 bits en A0. No confundir DAC con PWM; no hay bloque DAC nuevo.": "12-bit DAC on A0. Do not confuse DAC with PWM; no new DAC block is provided.",
        "I2C SDA; compartido con el bus Wire.": "I2C SDA; shared with the Wire bus.",
        "I2C SCL; compartido con el bus Wire.": "I2C SCL; shared with the Wire bus.",
        "USB nativo usa Serial; D0/D1 libres para Serial1.": "Native USB uses Serial; D0/D1 free for Serial1."
      }
    }
  },
